  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CoS min. hum. int. 09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sv Kyrkan Sm&#xe4;rrehumram 09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim is to support minor humanitarian interventions through the ACT alliance (Action of Churces Together) as a preparedness measure and a fast track funding arragement to meet immediate humanitarian needs of victims of sudden disasters. Expected results are that the CoS delivers required emergency assistance to the affected populations, in priority the most vulnerable.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja sm&#xe4;rre humanit&#xe4;ra insatser genom ACT alliansen som en mekanism f&#xf6;r att vara f&#xf6;rberedd och snabbt kunna skjuta till medel n&#xe4;r omedelbara humanit&#xe4;ra behov hos m&#xe4;nniskor som har drabbats av snabbt uppkomna humanit&#xf6;ra kriser. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultat &#xe4;r att SvK skall snabbt kunna leverera katastrofhj&#xe4;lp till drbbade befolkningar, fr&#xe4;mst de svagaste.</narrative>
  </description>
